# LifeFlow MCP, PostGIS and Custom Map Plan (English backup)

## Document status

- Status: Approved factual foundation implemented
- Date: 2026-09-24
- Scope: Architecture plan plus implementation baseline
- Implementation status: Phases 1-6 complete for the factual local-development slice
- Safety rule: Preserve all existing OSM, OSRM, POI and PostgreSQL data

Implementation evidence and known deployment gaps are recorded in
`HOUSING-QUERY-IMPLEMENTATION.md`. Recommendation, booking, payment, public
deployment and custom basemap work remain explicitly out of scope.

## 1. Objective

LifeFlow is a multi-service daily-life agent. Mapping is one capability inside a larger system that may coordinate:

- Housing search and relocation
- Moving and transport services
- Nearby healthcare
- Flights and travel
- Schedules, reminders and approvals
- Cost estimation and payment workflows
- Integration with a separately owned AI recommendation module

The target is not to clone every Google Maps feature. The target is to own a configurable LifeFlow map and location platform that can combine OpenStreetMap data with private LifeFlow data, partner data and agent workflows.

## 2. Current baseline

The following components already work and must remain available during future development.

### 2.1 Geographic source data

```text
D:\Bản đồ VN\Raw\vietnam-260922.osm.pbf
D:\Bản đồ VN\Cities\boundaries\hcm.geojson
D:\Bản đồ VN\Cities\boundaries\hanoi.geojson
D:\Bản đồ VN\Cities\boundaries\danang.geojson
D:\Bản đồ VN\Cities\pbf\hcm.osm.pbf
D:\Bản đồ VN\Cities\pbf\hanoi.osm.pbf
D:\Bản đồ VN\Cities\pbf\danang.osm.pbf
```

### 2.2 POI data

```text
D:\Bản đồ VN\Extracts\accommodations.osm.pbf
D:\Bản đồ VN\Extracts\hotels.osm.pbf
D:\Bản đồ VN\Extracts\accommodations.geojson
